From a880769a259c25af6f2a32e5c64631f313f44035 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: daveey <daveey@users.noreply.github.com>
Date: Wed, 11 Nov 2026 00:50:57 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] [daveey] Fence archive choices and commit their evidence
 atomically

Add optional precondition and reason-comment hooks matching unblock_task. Keep cleanup post-commit; refusals and exceptions retain neither comment nor state change. Enables the user-steps card projection to use core-owned transactions and an event receipt rather than an invalid nested write_txn.

Proof: new tests RED on missing kwargs, GREEN with 25 targeted archive tests; user-steps real-core projection integration passes resume/archive and replay after board commit.
